# Force HTTPS: instruct browsers to only ever connect over TLS (mirrors the
# marketing site). The HTTP→HTTPS redirect itself is the Cloudflare zone
# "Always Use HTTPS" setting.
#
# Content-Security-Policy (2026-10-04), REPORT-ONLY first. What the app
# really reaches for, and nothing else:
#   • script-src: its own bundle; 'wasm-unsafe-eval' for the OCR engine's
#     WebAssembly core (served from ./ocr, never a CDN); Google's sign-in
#     script (the SDK loads accounts.google.com/gsi/client on demand).
#     No 'unsafe-inline' and no 'unsafe-eval' — pdf.js runs with
#     isEvalSupported:false, and index.html's fallback is a file.
#   • style-src 'unsafe-inline': React style attributes, everywhere.
#   • connect-src: Supabase (API, auth, storage, realtime), the suite
#     changelog, the OCR language models on jsDelivr (@tesseract.js-data
#     only), the R2 hosted-files Worker, Google sign-in.
#   • worker-src 'self' blob:: pdf.js's and tesseract's workers are files here.
#   • frame-src: blob: previews and print, the certificate page's PDF (a
#     Supabase or R2 signed URL), Google sign-in.
#   • img-src https:: avatars and QR logos come from anywhere a user points.
# Checked by e2e/csp.e2e.mjs (the production build with these headers, every
# flow that loads something) and by the whole e2e suite against the dev server,
# which serves the same policy (vite.config.ts, cspDev()).
#
# Hardening (2026-10-04). Nothing in the suite frames this app (checked: the
# hub, the website, the SDK), and the app only ever frames its OWN blob: and
# storage URLs, which these don't govern — so refusing to be framed elsewhere
# costs nothing and closes off click-jacking the Send-to-sign and account
# actions. No Permissions-Policy: Scan needs the camera.
/*
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  X-Frame-Options: SAMEORIGIN
  Content-Security-Policy: frame-ancestors 'self'
  Content-Security-Policy-Report-Only: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' 'wasm-unsafe-eval' https://accounts.google.com/gsi/client; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https://accounts.google.com/gsi/style; img-src 'self' data: blob: https:; font-src 'self' data: blob:; connect-src 'self' data: blob: https://rygfxgalojojppxmhddo.supabase.co wss://rygfxgalojojppxmhddo.supabase.co https://changelog.unisim.co.uk https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@tesseract.js-data/ https://unisim-hosted-files.inbox-12f.workers.dev https://accounts.google.com/gsi/; worker-src 'self' blob:; frame-src 'self' blob: https://rygfxgalojojppxmhddo.supabase.co https://unisim-hosted-files.inbox-12f.workers.dev https://accounts.google.com/gsi/; media-src 'self' blob: data:; manifest-src 'self'; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self'
